2026-10-23T05:53:59.1265142Z       gate: tools/test_dev_preview.mjs reads it. Until 2026-08-15 it was written ONCE by hand and never again — this gate found it two days stale, claiming a version the mirror beside it did not have. That is the exact fault class this file exists for, found on its first run.
