2026-10-23T05:53:59.1280026Z   24x transformed — tools/pack_boot_sidecars.mjs (run by publish.sh) writes each scene's records packed against each other — every value three or more repeat shipped once in boot/shared.json — because a citation hundreds of records carry was paid for once per record on a first visit 1.51 MB over its 13 MB budget. scene-loader.js reads these and rehydrates; the records at their own URLs are untouched (T-2315)
